{"id":"665412","name":"紫菜虾滑掉秤汤","author":"独乐乐不如众乐乐","authorId":"1820812","desc":"","cover":"images/665412/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫菜","amount":"两片"},{"name":"虾滑","amount":"一包"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"两个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"打两个蛋。","img":"images/665412/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"打散。","img":"images/665412/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"紫菜泡发。","img":"images/665412/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"热锅倒油，煎一张蛋皮。","img":"images/665412/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用开水烫一下砧板和刀。","img":"images/665412/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把蛋皮切丝。","img":"images/665412/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"虾滑用清水解冻。","img":"images/665412/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烧开水，剪开虾滑，用勺子挖虾滑，下虾滑。","img":"images/665412/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"虾滑浮起，捞出。","img":"images/665412/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"另烧一锅水，倒入虾滑，紫菜，鸡蛋。","img":"images/665412/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"水开后，下调味料和葱花就可以！","img":"images/665412/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炖盅、煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}